---
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="accent-segment accent-red"></div>
    <div class="accent-segment accent-orange"></div>
    <div class="accent-segment accent-yellow"></div>
    <div class="accent-segment accent-green"></div>
    <div class="accent-segment accent-blue"></div>
    <div class="accent-segment accent-purple"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-content">
      <section class="footer-col">
        <h2 class="footer-col-heading">About</h2>
        <p>
          Writing on software development, teamwork, research, and the human side of complex systems.
          Grouped under <a href="/tags/dev/">software development</a>, <a href="/tags/hci/">human-computer interaction</a> and <a href="/tags/research/">research</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="footer-note">Opinions are my own, not those of my current, past or future employers.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="footer-col">
        <h2 class="footer-col-heading">Follow</h2>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> <span class="footer-note">full text</span></li>
          <li><a href="https://mastodon.social/@arttuv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mastodon</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="footer-col">
        <h2 class="footer-col-heading">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          To work together or just connect, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/arttu-viljakainen/">LinkedIn</a> is the best way to reach me.
          In Helsinki and want to have a beer? Sure, just drop a message. :)
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Arttu Viljakainen. Texts licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>.</p>
      <p>Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, hosted on <a href="https://pages.github.com/">GitHub Pages</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
    /* A colophon on the same paper as the page, under the Bauhaus stripe */
    footer {
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 5rem;
        background: var(--color-bg);
        color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .footer-accent-bar {
        display: flex;
        height: 6px;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .accent-segment {
        flex: 1;
    }

    .accent-red    { background-color: var(--color-red); }
    .accent-orange { background-color: var(--color-orange); }
    .accent-yellow { background-color: var(--color-yellow); }
    .accent-green  { background-color: var(--color-green); }
    .accent-blue   { background-color: var(--color-blue); }
    .accent-purple { background-color: var(--color-purple); }

    .footer-inner {
        max-width: 58rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2.25rem 0 1.75rem;
    }

    .footer-content {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
        gap: 2.5rem;
        padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .footer-col-heading {
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
        padding: 0 0 0.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        font-family: var(--font-condensed);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .footer-col p {
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
        font-family: var(--font-reading);
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer-links {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-reading);
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer-links li {
        margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    }

    .footer-col .footer-note,
    .footer-links .footer-note {
        font-family: var(--font-condensed);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-muted);
    }

    .footer-links .footer-note {
        margin-left: 0.35rem;
    }

    footer a,
    footer a:visited {
        color: var(--color-link);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding-top: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .footer-bottom p {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-condensed);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--color-muted);
    }

    .footer-bottom a,
    .footer-bottom a:visited {
        color: var(--color-muted);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 40%, transparent);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
        .footer-inner {
            padding-inline: 1.25rem;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
        .footer-content {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1.75rem;
        }

        .footer-inner {
            padding: 2rem clamp(0.75rem, 2.5vw, 1rem) 1.5rem;
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.25rem;
        }
    }
</style>
